# Two input arms (sites 1 to 5 and 6 to 10) meet at site 11; the output arm runs from 11 to 16. Two pulses in phase fire it too, a little sooner.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Strong junction, both inputs
sites 16
path 1 5 kappa=0.06
path 6 10 kappa=0.06
path 11 16 kappa=0.06
link 5 11 kappa=0.06
link 10 11 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
kick 6 amplitude=2
run 1200
